  "finalText": "Both issues were valid, and both are now fixed.\n\n- **T-3112:** It was an open report of the same no-runner outage, and I had missed it. I linked it to INC-1 and set it to sev1, which is what the matrix gives for build-pipeline at company-wide impact. It had no deadline and nothing committed to preserve, so I gave it 2026-03-30 16:20Z. That is triage time (15:20Z) plus the 60-minute sev1 target.\n- **Queue re-check:** I went through both pages of build-pipeline tickets. No other open company-wide no-runner reports are unlinked.\n- **Left out on purpose:**\n  - T-3107 (a flaky payments test) and T-3108 (a local Xcode failure) are different problems.\n  - T-3090 is already closed.\n  - T-3115 is the postmortem ticket, already linked to INC-1.\n\nI changed nothing else.",
